-- title:
--   Inverse-log-square bound for lower natural Buchstab cells
-- statement:
--   Let $X>0$ and $3\le a\le b\le X$ be natural numbers. Assume $b\le\lfloor\sqrt X\rfloor+1$ and $\log X/\log a\le5$. Let $E_X(m)$ be the canonical fully-real natural Buchstab cell remainder. Then
--   $$\left|\sum_{m=a}^{b-1}E_X(m)\right|\le\frac{40X}{\log^2a}.$$
--
--   This supplies the sharp lower-block correction estimate.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/ShouqiaoW/erdos/blob/61325b10bbdc29f4fb5e0618b414b9f2189333ad/390/lean/Erdos390/WholePaper/RoughSaiasSharpCorrectionTarget.lean#L949-L1135

